The AI components (registry/bitop/ui/{conversation, message, response,
reasoning, tool, sources, inline-citation, prompt-input, suggestion, shimmer,
loader, code-block, chain-of-thought, task, plan, confirmation, context,
model-selector, attachments, artifact, snippet, queue, checkpoint}) take
their component set, part names, composition patterns and several prop shapes
from Vercel's AI Elements (https://github.com/vercel/ai-elements), which is
