The implementation is original: bitop-ui's versions are written from scratch
on Base UI, CSS Modules and CSS variables, are SDK-agnostic (no `ai` package
types) and share no source files with AI Elements (which uses Tailwind CSS,
shadcn/ui, Radix and the Vercel AI SDK). Behaviours that follow AI Elements'
design, credited here:

  - Reasoning opens while streaming, closes once afterwards (1 s delay) and
    shows "Thinking…" / "Thought for N seconds".
  - PromptInputSubmit maps a chat status to send / spinner / stop.
  - Conversation sticks to the bottom with a scroll-to-latest button
    (AI Elements uses the use-stick-to-bottom package; bitop-ui implements
    its own logic).
